# ==========================================
# Backend Docker Ignore
# Exclude heavy binaries, traces, data, and logs
# ==========================================

# Dependencies
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Runtime Logs, Traces & Screenshots (Prevents BuildKit OOM crash)
runs
**/runs
**/runs/**
screenshots
**/screenshots
**/screenshots/**
*.log
**/*.log
backend.log
latest-trace.jsonl
**/*.jsonl

# Local Data, Resumes, and Non-Production Dirs
data
**/data
**/data/**
Data
**/Data
**/Data/**
resumes
**/resumes
**/resumes/**
docs
**/docs
**/docs/**

# Sensitive Environment Files
.env
.env.*

# Version Control & CI
.git
**/.git
.github
**/.github

# Build and Cache Artifacts
dist
**/dist
.cache
**/cache
scratch
**/scratch

# Non-essential markdown and docs
*.md
!README.md
